
Topic/Tutorial	Where to Find It (Based on Our Chat)	Key Function
1. Initial Launch & Access	Search for the response containing "Saving and Opening it as a Desktop App."	How to run the HTML file (i.e., saving as .html and double-clicking).
2. Updating the Content	Search for the phrase "Add more shortcuts to the internal JavaScript list."	How to edit the data by adding new entries to the factsData array inside the application file (app.html).
3. Fixing the VPS Login	Search for the response containing "The Solution: Use Your VPS Credentials" or "The Final Action: Manually Retype the Password."	How to log in via SSH/SCP by using your VPS IP, username, and Port 22.
4. Final Lead Funnel Connection	Search for the response containing "Step 2: Edit index.html on GitHub."	How to paste the Mailchimp Form Action URL into the <form> tag on the live index.html file.
5. The Final Launch URL	Search for the response containing "Your site is live at..."	The exact, final, live URL for your website on GitHub Pages.

